<html>
	<head>
		<meta charset='utf-8' />
		<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
		<title>Welcome to Drippy</title>
		<style>
			body {
				font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #333;
				max-width: 600px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 20px;
			}
			.header {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
				color: white;
				padding: 30px;
				text-align: center;
				border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
			}
			.content {
				background: #f9f9f9;
				padding: 30px;
				border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
			}
			.button {
				display: inline-block;
				background: #667eea;
				color: white;
				padding: 12px 30px;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 5px;
				margin: 20px 0;
			}
			.footer {
				text-align: center;
				margin-top: 30px;
				font-size: 12px;
				color: #666;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class='header'>
			<h1>Welcome to Drippy, {{userName}}! 🎨</h1>
		</div>

		<div class='content'>
			<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

			<p>Welcome to
				<strong>Drippy</strong>
				- where creativity meets technology! We're thrilled to have you join our community of designers and creators.</p>

			<p>Here's what you can do next:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>🎯 Explore our 3D design tools</li>
				<li>🎨 Create your first custom design</li>
				<li>📱 Try our mobile app for on-the-go creation</li>
				<li>👥 Connect with other creators in our community</li>
			</ul>

			<div style='text-align: center;'>
				<a href='{{appUrl}}' class='button'>Start Creating Now</a>
			</div>

			<p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team at
				<a href='mailto:support@drippy3d.com'>support@drippy3d.com</a></p>

			<p>Happy creating!</p>
			<p>The Drippy Team</p>
		</div>

		<div class='footer'>
			<p>© {{currentYear}} Drippy. All rights reserved.</p>
			<p>If you no longer wish to receive these emails, <a href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'>unsubscribe here</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
